			<dc:description>
				<rdf:Alt>
					<rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The MT9V024 is a 1/3â€inch wideâ€VGA format CMOS activeâ€pixel digital image sensor with global shutter and high dynamic range (HDR) operation. The sensor has specifically been designed to support the demanding interior and exterior automotive imaging needs, which makes this part ideal for a wide variety of imaging applications in realâ€world environments.</rdf:li>
